@local/dsh-openbot-artist-bridge README · Security notes：- The socket is owner-only. A prompt from another DSH user that joins the same turn is detected and rejected with a readable message instead of being merged silently.
- Frames are capped at 8 MiB.
- Configuration values (`botId`, `socketPath`) identify one machine's Bot; keep your real values in a profile override, not in a shared repository.
